{
  "info": {
    "name": "gateway-db (MongoDB sample) — ACL / Grant / Path / Stats",
    "description": "Runnable playlist for the Mongo-backed gateway (gateway-db sample) against http://localhost:3000 with a a Keycloak (demo realm) login.\n\nFOLDERS\n- ACL   : actions CRUD (name-keyed: PUT upserts, GET list/get, DELETE by name).\n- Roles : roles CRUD (name-keyed).\n- Grant : grant + revoke (dual; roles required) + resources + canUserDo (resource) + canUserDoGtw (no resource).\n- Path  : gateway-admin DB routes CRUD + runtime reload.\n- Stats : metrics (counters, time-series, raw points).\n- Auth  : auth-providers CRUD (name-keyed: create/list/get/update/delete).\n- Misc  : health, protected, paths export, manual metrics track.\n\nRUN ORDER: the top-level Login runs FIRST (stores {{token}} and decodes the subject into {{userId}}), then the folders top-to-bottom. ACL/Roles seed the actions+roles the Grant folder needs.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000" },
    { "key": "kcTokenUrl", "value": "https://auth.example.com/realms/demo/protocol/openid-connect/token" },
    { "key": "kcClientId", "value": "demo-client" },
    { "key": "kcUsername", "value": "user@example.com" },
    { "key": "kcPassword", "value": "REPLACE_ME" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000" },
    { "key": "lastPathId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Login (Keycloak password grant) — run first",
      "event": [
        { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
          "pm.test('login ok (200)', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200); });",
          "var j = pm.response.json();",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.access_token);",
          "function dec(t){ var s=t.split('.')[1].replace(/-/g,'+').replace(/_/g,'/'); var x=(typeof atob!=='undefined')?atob(s):Buffer.from(s,'base64').toString('binary'); return JSON.parse(x); }",
          "var p; try { p = dec(j.access_token); } catch (e) {}",
          "// Fail loud: grants/checks (below) and /protected MUST use the SAME identity. If the sub can't be decoded we must NOT silently fall back to the default userId.",
          "pm.test('decoded the token subject (sub -> userId)', function () { pm.expect(p && p.sub, 'JWT sub').to.be.ok; });",
          "if (p && p.sub) { pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', p.sub); console.log('logged in, userId =', p.sub); }"
        ] } }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }],
        "body": { "mode": "urlencoded", "urlencoded": [
          { "key": "grant_type", "value": "password" },
          { "key": "client_id", "value": "{{kcClientId}}" },
          { "key": "username", "value": "{{kcUsername}}" },
          { "key": "password", "value": "{{kcPassword}}" },
          { "key": "scope", "value": "openid profile" }
        ] },
        "url": { "raw": "{{kcTokenUrl}}", "host": ["{{kcTokenUrl}}"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ACL",
      "description": "Actions CRUD. Actions are keyed by NAME (no id): PUT creates-or-updates, GET lists, GET /get?name= reads one, DELETE removes by name. Seeds gateway-access / admin-access for the Roles + Grant folders.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "UPSERT · PUT /acl/actions  (gateway-access seed)",
          "event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('upserted', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200,201]); });"
          ] } } ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"gateway-access\",\n  \"description\": \"Access the protected HTTP routes\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/acl/actions", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["acl", "actions"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "UPSERT · PUT /acl/actions  (admin-access seed)",
          "event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('upserted', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200,201]); });"
          ] } } ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"admin-access\",\n  \"description\": \"Access the admin/management endpoints\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/acl/actions", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["acl", "actions"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "LIST · GET /acl/actions",
          "event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('200', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200); });",
            "pm.test('gateway-access present', function () { pm.expect(JSON.stringify(pm.response.json())).to.include('gateway-access'); });"
          ] } } ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/acl/actions?page=1&limit=50", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["acl", "actions"], "query": [{ "key": "page", "value": "1" }, { "key": "limit", "value": "50" }] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET · GET /acl/actions/get?name=gateway-access  (one by name)",
          "event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('200 + the action', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200); pm.expect(JSON.stringify(pm.response.json())).to.include('gateway-access'); });"
          ] } } ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/acl/actions/get?name=gateway-access", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["acl", "actions", "get"], "query": [{ "key": "name", "value": "gateway-access" }] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "UPSERT · PUT /acl/actions  (temp-action — create)",
          "event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('created via PUT', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200,201]); });"
          ] } } ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"temp-action\",\n  \"description\": \"throwaway\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/acl/actions", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["acl", "actions"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE · DELETE /acl/actions  (temp-action by name)",
          "event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('deleted', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200,204]); });"
          ] } } ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"temp-action\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/acl/actions", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["acl", "actions"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Roles",
      "description": "Roles CRUD. Roles are keyed by NAME (no id): PUT upserts, GET lists, GET /get?name= reads one, DELETE removes by name. Seeds user / admin (referencing the seeded actions) for the Grant folder.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "UPSERT · PUT /acl/roles  (user -> [gateway-access])",
          "event": [ { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('upserted', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200,201]); });"
          ] } } ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"user\",\n  \"description\": \"Standard user\",\n  \"actions\": [\"gateway-access\"]\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/acl/roles", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["acl", "roles"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "UPSERT · PUT /acl/roles  (admin -> [gateway-access, admin-access])",
